    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a chapter. it feels like i'm just a constant reminder of everything they lost. i see the way they look at me sometimes, like they're trying to pretend i'm okay, but i know they can see the failure. if i could just go back and fix it, or if i just wasn't around to keep dragging them down with my mistakes... maybe things would finally be clean for them. maybe they could just be proud of the life they built without having to deal with the mess i've become.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
