      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying the weight of their perceived disappointment, but you need to understand that their love is not conditional on your achievements. They sacrificed for *you*, not for a flawless version of you. The way they look at you is likely a mix of love, worry, and perhaps a little sadness, not condemnation. Instead of trying to erase the past, focus on the present moment and what you can do to make things better for yourself.",
      "source": "target",
